{
  "luke.24.p1.b1": {
    "text": "七日的头一日，黎明的时候，那些妇女带着所预备的香料来到坟墓前，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "七⁠日的头一⁠日，黎⁠明的时⁠候，那⁠些妇⁠女带着所预⁠备的香⁠料来⁠到坟⁠墓前，"
  },
  "luke.24.p1.b2": {
    "text": "看见石头已经从坟墓滚开了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "看⁠见石⁠头已⁠经从坟⁠墓滚⁠开了，"
  },
  "luke.24.p1.b3": {
    "text": "她们就进去，只是不见主耶稣的身体。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "她⁠们就进⁠去，只⁠是不⁠见主耶⁠稣的身⁠体。"
  },
  "luke.24.p2.b1": {
    "text": "正在猜疑之间，忽然有两个人站在旁边，衣服放光。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "正⁠在猜⁠疑之⁠间，忽⁠然有两个⁠人站⁠在旁⁠边，衣⁠服放⁠光。"
  },
  "luke.24.p2.b2": {
    "text": "为什么在死人中找活人呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "为⁠什⁠么在死⁠人中找活⁠人呢？"
  },
  "luke.24.p2.b3": {
    "text": "他不在这里，已经复活了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他不⁠在这⁠里，已⁠经复⁠活了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p2.b4": {
    "text": "人子必须被交在罪人手里，钉在十字架上，第三日复活。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人⁠子必⁠须被交在罪⁠人手⁠里，钉⁠在十⁠字⁠架上，第⁠三日复⁠活。"
  },
  "luke.24.p3.b1": {
    "text": "她们就想起耶稣的话来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "她⁠们就想⁠起耶⁠稣的⁠话来，"
  },
  "luke.24.p3.b2": {
    "text": "那告诉使徒的就是抹大拉的马利亚和约亚拿，并雅各的母亲马利亚，还有与她们在一处的妇女。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那告⁠诉使⁠徒的就⁠是抹⁠大⁠拉的马⁠利⁠亚和⁠约亚拿，并雅⁠各的母⁠亲马⁠利⁠亚，还⁠有与她⁠们在一处⁠的妇⁠女。"
  },
  "luke.24.p3.b3": {
    "text": "她们这些话，使徒以为是胡言，就不相信。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "她⁠们这⁠些话，使⁠徒以⁠为⁠是胡⁠言，就⁠不相⁠信。"
  },
  "luke.24.p4.b1": {
    "text": "彼得起来，跑到坟墓前，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "彼⁠得起⁠来，跑⁠到坟⁠墓前，"
  },
  "luke.24.p4.b2": {
    "text": "低头往里看，见细麻布独在一处，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "低⁠头往⁠里看，见细⁠麻⁠布独在一处，"
  },
  "luke.24.p4.b3": {
    "text": "就回去了，心里希奇所成的事。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就回⁠去了，心⁠里希⁠奇所成的事。"
  },
  "luke.24.p5.b1": {
    "text": "正当那日，门徒中有两个人往一个村子去；这村子名叫以马忤斯，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "正⁠当那日，门⁠徒中⁠有两个⁠人往一⁠个村⁠子去；这村⁠子名⁠叫以马忤斯，"
  },
  "luke.24.p5.b2": {
    "text": "他们彼此谈论所遇见的这一切事。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们彼⁠此谈⁠论所遇⁠见的这一⁠切事。"
  },
  "luke.24.p5.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣亲自就近他们，和他们同行；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣亲⁠自就⁠近他⁠们，和他⁠们同⁠行；"
  },
  "luke.24.p5.b4": {
    "text": "只是他们的眼睛迷糊了，不认识他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "只⁠是他⁠们的眼⁠睛迷⁠糊了，不认⁠识他。"
  },
  "luke.24.p6.b1": {
    "text": "你们走路彼此谈论的是什么事呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们走⁠路彼⁠此谈⁠论的⁠是什⁠么事呢？"
  },
  "luke.24.p6.b2": {
    "text": "他们就站住，脸上带着愁容。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就站⁠住，脸上带着愁⁠容。"
  },
  "luke.24.p6.b3": {
    "text": "二人中有一个名叫革流巴的回答说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "二⁠人中⁠有一⁠个名⁠叫革流巴的回⁠答⁠说："
  },
  "luke.24.p6.b4": {
    "text": "你在耶路撒冷作客，还不知道这几天在那里所出的事吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠在耶⁠路撒⁠冷作⁠客，还不⁠知⁠道这⁠几⁠天在那⁠里所出的事吗？"
  },
  "luke.24.p7.b1": {
    "text": "什么事呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "什⁠么事呢？"
  },
  "luke.24.p7.b2": {
    "text": "就是拿撒勒人耶稣的事。他是个先知，在　神和众百姓面前，说话行事都有大能。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠是拿⁠撒⁠勒人耶⁠稣的事。他⁠是个先⁠知，在　神和众百⁠姓面⁠前，说⁠话行⁠事都⁠有大能。"
  },
  "luke.24.p7.b3": {
    "text": "祭司长和我们的官府竟把他解去，定了死罪，钉在十字架上。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "祭⁠司⁠长和我⁠们的官⁠府竟⁠把他解去，定了死⁠罪，钉⁠在十⁠字⁠架上。"
  },
  "luke.24.p7.b4": {
    "text": "但我们素来所盼望、要赎以色列民的就是他！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但我⁠们素来所盼⁠望、要赎以⁠色⁠列民的就⁠是他！"
  },
  "luke.24.p8.b1": {
    "text": "再者，我们中间有几个妇女使我们惊奇；她们清早到了坟墓那里，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "再⁠者，我⁠们中⁠间有几⁠个妇⁠女使我⁠们惊⁠奇；她⁠们清⁠早到⁠了坟⁠墓那⁠里，"
  },
  "luke.24.p8.b2": {
    "text": "……就回来告诉我们，说看见了天使显现，说他活了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……就回⁠来告⁠诉我⁠们，说看⁠见了天⁠使显⁠现，说他活⁠了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p8.b3": {
    "text": "又有我们的几个人往坟墓那里去，所遇见的正如妇女们所说的，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又⁠有我⁠们的几⁠个人往坟⁠墓那⁠里去，所遇⁠见的正⁠如妇⁠女们所说⁠的，"
  },
  "luke.24.p8.b4": {
    "text": "只是没有看见他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "只⁠是没⁠有看⁠见他。"
  },
  "luke.24.p9.b1": {
    "text": "无知的人哪，先知所说的一切话，你们的心信得太迟钝了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "无⁠知的人哪，先⁠知所说⁠的一⁠切话，你⁠们的心信得太迟⁠钝了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p9.b2": {
    "text": "基督这样受害，又进入他的荣耀，岂不是应当的吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "基⁠督这⁠样受⁠害，又进⁠入他⁠的荣⁠耀，岂⁠不⁠是应⁠当的吗？"
  },
  "luke.24.p9.b3": {
    "text": "于是从摩西和众先知起，凡经上所指着自己的话都给他们讲解明白了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是从摩⁠西和众先⁠知起，凡经上⁠所指着自⁠己的⁠话都给他⁠们讲⁠解明⁠白了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p10.b1": {
    "text": "将近他们所去的村子，耶稣好像还要往前行，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "将⁠近他⁠们所去的村⁠子，耶⁠稣好⁠像还要往⁠前行，"
  },
  "luke.24.p10.b2": {
    "text": "时候晚了，日头已经平西了，请你同我们住下吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "时⁠候晚了，日头已⁠经平⁠西了，请你同我⁠们住下吧！"
  },
  "luke.24.p10.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣就进去，要同他们住下。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就进⁠去，要同他⁠们住下。"
  },
  "luke.24.p11.b1": {
    "text": "到了坐席的时候，耶稣拿起饼来，祝谢了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "到⁠了坐⁠席的时⁠候，耶⁠稣拿⁠起饼来，祝谢了，"
  },
  "luke.24.p11.b2": {
    "text": "擘开，递给他们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "擘开，递给他⁠们。"
  },
  "luke.24.p11.b3": {
    "text": "他们的眼睛明亮了，这才认出他来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们的眼⁠睛明⁠亮了，这才认⁠出他来。"
  },
  "luke.24.p11.b4": {
    "text": "忽然耶稣不见了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "忽⁠然耶⁠稣不⁠见⁠了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p12.b1": {
    "text": "在路上，他和我们说话，给我们讲解圣经的时候，我们的心岂不是火热的吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在路⁠上，他和我⁠们说⁠话，给我⁠们讲⁠解圣⁠经的时⁠候，我⁠们的心岂⁠不⁠是火热的吗？"
  },
  "luke.24.p12.b2": {
    "text": "他们就立时起身，回耶路撒冷去，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就立时起⁠身，回耶⁠路撒⁠冷去，"
  },
  "luke.24.p12.b3": {
    "text": "主果然复活，已经现给西门看了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主果⁠然复⁠活，已⁠经现给西⁠门看⁠了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p12.b4": {
    "text": "两个人就把路上所遇见，和擘饼的时候怎么被他们认出来的事，都述说了一遍。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "两个⁠人就⁠把路⁠上所遇⁠见，和擘饼的时⁠候怎⁠么被他⁠们认⁠出⁠来的事，都述说了一⁠遍。"
  },
  "luke.24.p13.b1": {
    "text": "正说这话的时候，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "正说这话的时⁠候，"
  },
  "luke.24.p13.b2": {
    "text": "愿你们平安！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "愿你⁠们平⁠安！"
  },
  "luke.24.p13.b3": {
    "text": "他们却惊慌害怕，以为所看见的是魂。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们却惊⁠慌害⁠怕，以⁠为所看⁠见的⁠是魂。"
  },
  "luke.24.p13.b4": {
    "text": "你们看我的手，我的脚，就知道实在是我了。摸我看看！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们看我⁠的手，我⁠的脚，就知⁠道实⁠在是我了。摸我看⁠看！"
  },
  "luke.24.p14.b1": {
    "text": "他们正喜得不敢信，并且希奇；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们正⁠喜得不⁠敢信，并⁠且希⁠奇；"
  },
  "luke.24.p14.b2": {
    "text": "你们这里有什么吃的没有？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们这⁠里有什⁠么吃的没⁠有？"
  },
  "luke.24.p14.b3": {
    "text": "他们便给他一片烧鱼。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们便给他一⁠片烧鱼。"
  },
  "luke.24.p14.b4": {
    "text": "他接过来，在他们面前吃了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他接⁠过⁠来，在他⁠们面⁠前吃⁠了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p15.b1": {
    "text": "摩西的律法、先知的书，和诗篇上所记的，凡指着我的话都必须应验。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "摩⁠西的律⁠法、先⁠知的书，和诗⁠篇上⁠所记的，凡指着我的⁠话都必⁠须应验。"
  },
  "luke.24.p15.b2": {
    "text": "于是耶稣开他们的心窍，使他们能明白圣经，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是耶⁠稣开他⁠们的心窍，使他⁠们能明⁠白圣⁠经，"
  },
  "luke.24.p15.b3": {
    "text": "照经上所写的，基督必受害，第三日从死里复活，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "照经上⁠所写⁠的，基⁠督必受⁠害，第⁠三日从死里复⁠活，"
  },
  "luke.24.p15.b4": {
    "text": "并且人要奉他的名传悔改、赦罪的道，从耶路撒冷起直传到万邦。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "并⁠且人要奉他⁠的名传悔⁠改、赦⁠罪的道，从耶⁠路撒⁠冷起直⁠传到万⁠邦。"
  },
  "luke.24.p16.b1": {
    "text": "你们就是这些事的见证。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们就⁠是这⁠些事的见⁠证。"
  },
  "luke.24.p16.b2": {
    "text": "我要将我父所应许的降在你们身上，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:49"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠要将我父所应⁠许的降在你⁠们身⁠上，"
  },
  "luke.24.p16.b3": {
    "text": "你们要在城里等候，直到你们领受从上头来的能力。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:49"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们要在城里等⁠候，直⁠到你⁠们领⁠受从上⁠头来的能⁠力。"
  },
  "luke.24.p17.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣领他们到伯大尼的对面，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣领他⁠们到伯⁠大⁠尼的对⁠面，"
  },
  "luke.24.p17.b2": {
    "text": "就举手给他们祝福。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就举手给他⁠们祝⁠福。"
  },
  "luke.24.p17.b3": {
    "text": "正祝福的时候，他就离开他们，被带到天上去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "正祝⁠福的时⁠候，他就离⁠开他⁠们，被带⁠到天⁠上去⁠了。"
  },
  "luke.24.p18.b1": {
    "text": "他们就拜他，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就拜他，"
  },
  "luke.24.p18.b2": {
    "text": "大大地欢喜，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "大大⁠地欢⁠喜，"
  },
  "luke.24.p18.b3": {
    "text": "回耶路撒冷去，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "回耶⁠路撒⁠冷去，"
  },
  "luke.24.p19.b1": {
    "text": "常在殿里称颂神。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Luke 24:53"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "常⁠在殿⁠里称⁠颂神。"
  }
}
